
## StyleX Configuration

This project is configured with [StyleX](https://stylexjs.com/).

### Turbopack Limitation
Because StyleX requires a custom Babel plugin (`babel.config.js`), Next.js opts out of SWC. 
As a result, `next dev --turbo` is not supported (the Babel plugin will be ignored). 
Always use the standard `npm run dev` (Webpack) for development.

### Usage

Check out the `StyleXExample.tsx` component and the theme tokens in `theme/tokens.stylex.ts`.
